  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to National Girls Summit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposal is to provide a small amount of funding to the National Girls Summit (NGS). In line with the FCDO Women and Girls Strategy, this would contribute to the BHC&#x2019;s country plan objective of empowering women and girls, specifically by supporting coalitions that effectively champion gender equality and inclusion (and counter gender-based violence, advocate for sexual and reproductive rights, and challenge harmful social norms). This support would demonstrate the BHC&#x2019;s commitment to supporting girls&#x2019; activism &#x2013; building on the launch of the MOVE programme and our sustained communications over the past year. This engagement would also help demonstrate the BHC&#x2019;s shift to widening our partnerships and supporting more locally led development.</narrative>
  </description>
